<title>USA: Nordic skiing-World Cup standings.</title>
<headline>Nordic skiing-World Cup standings.</headline>
<dateline>STEAMBOAT SPRINGS, Colo. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nordic</p>
<p>combined World Cup standings after two events on Wednesday:</p>
<p>1. Jari Mantila (Finland) 225 points.</p>
<p>2. Sampaa Lajunen (Finland) 190</p>
<p>3. Knute Tore Apeland (Norway) 180</p>
<p>4. Halldo Skard (Norway) 173</p>
<p>5. Bjarte Engen Vik (Norway) 146</p>
<p>6. Tim Tetrault (United States) 145</p>
<p>=7. Tie Mario Stecher (Austria) 135</p>
<p>=7. Kenji Ogiwara (Japan) 135</p>
<p>9. Trond Einar Elden (Norway) 127</p>
<p>10. Kristian Hammer (Norway) 115</p>
